=== intro

A sharp ping against the hull. Then another. Then a spray of them—a micrometeorite cluster, invisible until impact. The void is full of debris since the Silence. Shattered stations. Dead fleets. All of it drifting.

Warning lights flare. Pressure dropping in cargo bay three.

* [Emergency seal—sacrifice some cargo]
  ~ damage hull 5
  ~ credits -= 30
  ~ chronicle "Meteorite Strike"
    Micrometeorites breached cargo bay three. We sealed it, but lost some cargo to the void.
  -> END

* [Attempt manual repair] { crew.engineering }
  ~ damage hull 2
  ~ chronicle "Breach Contained"
